#: ../../source/docs/common-blitz-f745.rst:95 3fec78d900cb4c23bd99c976fecf4064
msgid "RC Input"
msgstr "RC输入"

#: ../../source/docs/common-blitz-f745.rst:97 73d367f35a1b49caa0ef641d87d98afa
msgid ""
"RC input is configured on the R2 (UART2_RX) pin. It supports all RC "
"protocols except PPM. See :ref:`common-rc-systems` for details for a "
"specific RC system. :ref:`SERIAL2_PROTOCOL<SERIAL2_PROTOCOL>` is set to "
"\"23\", by default, to enable this."
msgstr ""
"RC输入配置在R2（UART2_RX）引脚，支持除PPM以外的所有RC协议。特定RC系统的详细信息请参阅 :ref:`common-rc-"
"systems`。:ref:`SERIAL2_PROTOCOL<SERIAL2_PROTOCOL>` 默认设置为 「23」以启用此功能。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-blitz-f745.rst:99 26a6bf922d5b4c3aafcf0c8fbe2fda80
msgid ""
"FPort requires connection to T2 and :ref:`SERIAL2_OPTIONS<SERIAL2_OPTIONS>` "
"be set to \"7\"."
msgstr "FPort需连接T2，且须将 :ref:`SERIAL2_OPTIONS<SERIAL2_OPTIONS>` 设置为 「7」。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-blitz-f745.rst:101
#: b644a52de53749288e0c0f850dff3cfc
msgid ""
"CRSF also requires a T2 connection, in addition to R2, and automatically "
"provides telemetry. Set :ref:`SERIAL2_OPTIONS<SERIAL2_OPTIONS>` to \"0\"."
msgstr ""
"CRSF除需连接R2外，还需连接T2，并自动提供数传。将 :ref:`SERIAL2_OPTIONS<SERIAL2_OPTIONS>` 设置为 "
"「0」。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-blitz-f745.rst:103
#: 44a7cac784ee4115bac095371b3dc44a
msgid ""
"SRXL2 requires a connecton to T2 and automatically provides telemetry.  Set "
":ref:`SERIAL2_OPTIONS<SERIAL2_OPTIONS>` to \"4\"."
msgstr "SRXL2需连接T2，并自动提供数传。将 :ref:`SERIAL2_OPTIONS<SERIAL2_OPTIONS>` 设置为 「4」。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-blitz-f745.rst:105
#: fc1fbe3bf9764433aa42dbe48a412d8f
msgid ""
"Any UART can be used for RC system connections in ArduPilot also, and is "
"compatible with all protocols except PPM. See :ref:`common-rc-systems` for "
"details."
msgstr ""
"在ArduPilot中，任意UART均可用于RC系统连接，兼容除PPM以外的所有协议。详情请参阅 :ref:`common-rc-systems`。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-blitz-f745.rst:108
#: 04e8293cd11347e59cb0cb7097d9aba6
msgid "OSD Support"
msgstr "OSD支持"

#: ../../source/docs/common-blitz-f745.rst:110
#: a8eaf85049464ca2a02ddadfa80956ac
msgid ""
"The autopilot  supports OSD using :ref:`OSD_TYPE<OSD_TYPE>` 1 (MAX7456 "
"driver). The defaults are also setup to allow DJI Goggle OSD support on "
"UART4. Both the internal analog OSD and the DisplayPort OSD can be used "
"simultaneously by setting :ref:`OSD_TYPE2<OSD_TYPE2>` = 5 (setup by default)"
msgstr ""
"飞控支持通过 :ref:`OSD_TYPE<OSD_TYPE>` 1（MAX7456驱动）使用OSD。默认配置同时支持通过UART4使用DJI "
"Goggle OSD。通过将 :ref:`OSD_TYPE2<OSD_TYPE2>` "
"设置为5（默认已配置），可同时使用内置模拟OSD和DisplayPort OSD。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-blitz-f745.rst:113
#: ace36ceba4a741a8847a87f66e6a4129
msgid "PWM Output"
msgstr "PWM输出"

#: ../../source/docs/common-blitz-f745.rst:115
#: a9c8acb23f764a7f820ddfe42364f6bc
msgid ""
"The  BLITZ F745 supports up to 9 PWM outputs (PWM 9 defaults to serial LED "
"output). Outputs 1-4 are available via a JST-SH connector, others via solder"
" pads. All outputs support DShot, as well as all PWM types. The first 4 "
"outputs support bi-directional DShot also."
msgstr ""
"BLITZ F745最多支持9路PWM输出（PWM 9默认为串行LED输出）。输出1-4通过JST-"
"SH连接器引出，其余通过焊盘引出。所有输出均支持DShot及所有PWM类型，前4路输出还支持双向DShot。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-blitz-f745.rst:117
#: 1a7e919ac4774b50a09cd07d4f693f3a
msgid "The PWM is in 3 groups:"
msgstr "PWM分为3组："

#: ../../source/docs/common-blitz-f745.rst:119
#: aabef216a8dd4bc7b529e42ab7cd6d26
msgid "PWM 1-4 in group1"
msgstr "PWM 1-4 在第1组"

#: ../../source/docs/common-blitz-f745.rst:120
#: e25070952fa84fc6a102338b9dc75d87
msgid "PWM 5-8 in group2"
msgstr "PWM 5-8 在第2组"

#: ../../source/docs/common-blitz-f745.rst:121
#: d9ad893b15ac4c318b99cea0705117ba
msgid "PWM 9 in group3"
msgstr "PWM 9 在第3组"

#: ../../source/docs/common-blitz-f745.rst:123
#: fd845b05502c40e4ab28e1722c0d34a2
msgid ""
"Channels within the same group need to use the same output rate, whether PWM"
" or Dshot. If any channel in a group uses DShot then all channels in the "
"group need to use DShot."
msgstr "同一组内的通道必须使用相同的输出频率，无论是PWM还是DShot。若某组中任一通道使用DShot，则该组所有通道均需使用DShot。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-blitz-f745.rst:127
#: 0e9666213c86429abb1e6d65989f99a5
msgid ""
"for users migrating from BetaflightX quads, the first four outputs M1-M4 "
"have been configured for use with existing motor wiring using these default "
"parameters:"
msgstr "对于从BetaflightX四轴迁移的用户，前四路输出M1-M4已按以下默认参数配置，可直接适配现有电机接线："

#: ../../source/docs/common-blitz-f745.rst:129
#: ea1f86c11c58433fb431ae810663b6ea
msgid ":ref:`FRAME_CLASS<FRAME_CLASS>` = 1 (Quad)"
msgstr ":ref:`FRAME_CLASS<FRAME_CLASS>` = 1（Quad）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-blitz-f745.rst:130
#: 4dabf39c2e8f41ba852915541628940b
msgid ":ref:`FRAME_TYPE<FRAME_TYPE>` = 12 (BetaFlightX)"
msgstr ":ref:`FRAME_TYPE<FRAME_TYPE>` = 12（BetaFlightX）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-blitz-f745.rst:133
#: 8ae1ca5dcb7b49428a251d139a4d5383
msgid "LED Output"
msgstr "LED输出"

#: ../../source/docs/common-blitz-f745.rst:135
#: ba437174b6f141c6a9942daf3842204e
msgid ""
"The LED output is configured by default to support :ref:`NeoPixel LED "
"strings<common-serial-led-neopixel>`."
msgstr "LED输出默认配置为支持 :ref:`NeoPixel LED灯条<common-serial-led-neopixel>`。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-blitz-f745.rst:138
#: d3e9b49d2434455f9e647e20c08161ad
msgid "Battery Monitoring"
msgstr "电池监测"

#: ../../source/docs/common-blitz-f745.rst:140
#: c930db962f0f47d09926699fca1b7856
msgid ""
"The board has a built-in voltage sensor via the B+ pin, but no internal "
"current sensor. An external current sensor can be connected to the CUR pin. "
"Default parameters for both internal voltage and external current monitoring"
" are set by default to the below for use with any Holybro Tekko32 F4 4in1 "
"ESC."
msgstr ""
"该板通过B+引脚内置电压传感器，但无内置电流传感器。可将外部电流传感器连接至CUR引脚。内置电压及外部电流监测的默认参数已预设，适用于Holybro "
"Tekko32 F4 4合1 ESC。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-blitz-f745.rst:142
#: 3149d4832d4f4955a316c81fcd91ab6b
msgid "The correct battery setting parameters are:"
msgstr "正确的电池参数设置如下："

#: ../../source/docs/common-blitz-f745.rst:144
#: 5bd886ed9b3644399d7f493c40cd0581
msgid ":ref:`BATT_MONITOR<BATT_MONITOR>` 4"
msgstr ":ref:`BATT_MONITOR<BATT_MONITOR>` 4"

#: ../../source/docs/common-blitz-f745.rst:145
#: 42f92a60951d4d08855a3f9712d01b48
msgid ":ref:`BATT_VOLT_PIN<BATT_VOLT_PIN__AP_BattMonitor_Analog>` 13"
msgstr ":ref:`BATT_VOLT_PIN<BATT_VOLT_PIN__AP_BattMonitor_Analog>` 13"

#: ../../source/docs/common-blitz-f745.rst:146
#: a6a39fdbf8d243cabf29a4e33c08fa71
msgid ":ref:`BATT_CURR_PIN<BATT_CURR_PIN__AP_BattMonitor_Analog>` 12"
msgstr ":ref:`BATT_CURR_PIN<BATT_CURR_PIN__AP_BattMonitor_Analog>` 12"

#: ../../source/docs/common-blitz-f745.rst:147
#: 7b479f899ab3436b88db945544413157
msgid ":ref:`BATT_VOLT_MULT<BATT_VOLT_MULT__AP_BattMonitor_Analog>` 11"
msgstr ":ref:`BATT_VOLT_MULT<BATT_VOLT_MULT__AP_BattMonitor_Analog>` 11"

#: ../../source/docs/common-blitz-f745.rst:148
#: 3f26a5bf8b55411a9024153b9f505f96
msgid ""
":ref:`BATT_AMP_PERVLT<BATT_AMP_PERVLT__AP_BattMonitor_Analog>` 50 but varies"
" depending on external current sensor"
msgstr ""
":ref:`BATT_AMP_PERVLT<BATT_AMP_PERVLT__AP_BattMonitor_Analog>` "
"50，但具体数值取决于外接电流传感器"

#: ../../source/docs/common-blitz-f745.rst:151
#: 1c8364ae47104bc8a5ec27149373e72f
msgid "Compass"
msgstr "罗盘"

#: ../../source/docs/common-blitz-f745.rst:153
#: bb97da1ef88f47ae9c6d76a9ed58a161
msgid ""
"This autopilot does not have a built-in compass, however you can attach an "
"external compass using I2C on the SDA and SCL pads."
msgstr "本飞控无内置罗盘，但可通过SDA和SCL焊盘使用I2C连接外部罗盘。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-blitz-f745.rst:156
#: 69daf202413e4fba80662040b8330c58
msgid "Firmware"
msgstr "固件"

#: ../../source/docs/common-blitz-f745.rst:158
#: 04aa6a8074434f14850cfed2909d9adc
msgid ""
"Firmware for these boards can be found `here "
"<https://firmware.ardupilot.org>`_ in  sub-folders labeled \"BlitzF745\"."
msgstr "该板的固件可在 `此处 <https://firmware.ardupilot.org>`_ 的 「BlitzF745」 子文件夹中找到。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-blitz-f745.rst:161
#: db9962ea20c34354bd0d46110fcec8e1
msgid "Loading Firmware"
msgstr "加载固件"

#: ../../source/docs/common-blitz-f745.rst:163
#: 27564579d25048c1b4cb314d0551acce
msgid ""
"Initial firmware load can be done with DFU by plugging in USB with the "
"bootloader button pressed. Then you should load the \"with_bl.hex\" "
"firmware, using your favourite DFU loading tool."
msgstr "首次固件加载可通过DFU完成：按住引导程序按钮并插入USB。然后使用您常用的DFU工具加载 「with_bl.hex」 固件。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-blitz-f745.rst:167
#: b261db7955264f6bb44a71770e0b12b1
msgid ""
"Once the initial firmware is loaded you can update the firmware using any "
"ArduPilot ground station software. Later updates should be done with the "
"\\*.apj firmware files."
msgstr "初始固件加载完成后，可使用任意ArduPilot地面站软件更新固件。后续更新请使用 \\*.apj 固件文件。"
